    "updated_at": "2017-08-14T16:33:51Z",
    "body": "It's basically that with error handling. See the `window.atob()` algorithm in HTML. All we need to do is abstract that and make it reusable. As far as I can tell browsers use the same processing for data: URLs (apart from maybe some minor whitespace handling differences that we can hopefully remove by testing all the endpoints with a single test suite).",
